<title>USA: Cooper Tire to buy back up to 5 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Cooper Tire to buy back up to 5 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>FINDLAY, Ohio 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cooper Tire &amp; Rubber Co said Tuesday it plans to buy back up to five million shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The purchases are to be made from time to time.  The company now has 78,678,772 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>&quot;The current stock price, we believe, undervalues the company and presents the company an opportunity to reduce the number of outstanding shares,&quot; Chairman Patrick Rooney said in a statement.</p>
<p>He added that the purchases are to be made with &quot;normal cash flows from operations and debt,&quot; and should not &quot;impinge on our planned capital investments in strategic plant and equipment.&quot;</p>
</text>
